
Unit tests for CPDN control code
================================

Glenn Carver, CPDN, 2025.

To run all the unit tests, in the top directory (not in utests subdir),
do the following steps:

1. mkdir build
2. cd build
3. cmake ..
4. cmake --build .
5. ctest  (or ctest -V for to see all test output)

To run a single test, call the unit_tests executable with the name of
the test as written in the code
e.g.
    build/utests/unit_tests "Read RCF File"


